      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want to be \"enough\" as this. i'm just tired of pretending there's a future when the world has already written me off. it's like i'm just lingering in a space that doesn't belong to me anymore. everything feels so permanent, like the damage is just... final.",
